Tidy: cleaning and repair of HTML documents with libtidy (tidy-html5)
of the package az.

The module tidy of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20230831/tidy.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its headers in
include/php83/php/ext/tidy.
